</style></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="f2e8b620-750a-1ca1-5908-7d656e0e78e6" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="image_strategy-wrapper"><div style="padding-top:56.17021276595745%" class="w-embed-youtubevideo"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/0CKfhshSmw0?rel=1&amp;controls=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;mute=0&amp;start=0" frameBorder="0" style="position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:auto" allow="autoplay; encrypted-media" allowfullscreen="" title="National Wealth Fund Invests in Tungsten West"></iframe></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_approach"><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-large w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid approach_halves"><div data-w-id="d47511d2-6643-c755-cda5-83e2d3808c02" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="left_approach"><h2 class="heading-style-h2 margin-0">A future that starts with the people who call this place <span class="text-color-teal">home.</span></h2><p class="margin-0">Tungsten West Plc is listed on the London Stock Exchange&#x27;s AIM market. We own and operate the Hemerdon Mine at Drakelands, South Devon – one of the world&#x27;s largest non-Chinese tungsten resources - and we&#x27;re bringing it back into full production.<br/><br/>We&#x27;re creating hundreds of skilled jobs across the Southwest, supplying the UK with a critical mineral the world urgently needs, and building something this region can be proud of for generations.</p></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid_numbers"><div data-w-id="d4669d59-2421-8ec3-f14c-78a29c203fce" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="card_number"><div id="" class="wrap_number"><span class="margin-0 heading-alternative"><div data-delay="0.3" data-count-to="350" data-duration="1">350</div></span><span class="margin-0 heading-alternative"><div>+</div></span></div><div class="label-large text-color-teal">DIRECT JOBS CREATED</div></div><div data-w-id="45dc1313-f0bf-c341-c3c1-e1fcb669067b" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="card_number"><div id="" class="wrap_number"><span class="margin-0 heading-alternative"><div data-delay="0.3" data-count-to="40" data-duration="1.4">40</div></span><span class="margin-0 heading-alternative"><div> years</div></span></div><div class="label-large text-color-teal">Full mine life with Hemerdon Futures</div></div><div id="w-node-ffffbf29-1854-042f-d5bb-9a8b4b628eb4-fac9a263" data-w-id="ffffbf29-1854-042f-d5bb-9a8b4b628eb4" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="card_number is-last"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69f56f4f180c2e2cde914715_Webclip.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="card_image"/></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_strategy"><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-large w-container"><div data-w-id="ab15572d-5903-445b-3131-a1bc86faca71" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="headline_single-case"><div class="text-color-black"><div class="master_label"><div class="icon-label"></div><div class="text-size-small">Our Strategy</div></div></div><div class="div-block-3"><h2 class="text-color-green">Unlock the Future of Tungsten</h2><p class="margin-0">Explore how Tungsten West is positioning itself as a key supplier of critical minerals. Discover the project’s economics, sustainability strategy, and growth potential.</p></div><div class="button_group_center"><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div data-pdf="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3cf43485ab7fac9a296/69e0c8072c7a4c61249496a6_Restarting%20Hemerdon%20Corporate%20Presentation%20