  }
    
</style></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide slide-5"><div class="card_carousel"><div class="image_carousel-card"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a8d696a92c6259c97f2f216_Tungsten%20West%20Restart%20Equipment.jpg" alt="Woman in a blue denim jacket gently petting a large white dog outdoors in a forest setting." sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a8d696a92c6259c97f2f216_Tungsten%20West%20Restart%20Equipment-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a8d696a92c6259c97f2f216_Tungsten%20West%20Restart%20Equipment-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a8d696a92c6259c97f2f216_Tungsten%20West%20Restart%20Equipment-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a8d696a92c6259c97f2f216_Tungsten%20West%20Restart%20Equipment-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a8d696a92c6259c97f2f216_Tungsten%20West%20Restart%20Equipment-p-2000.jpg 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a8d696a92c6259c97f2f216_Tungsten%20West%20Restart%20Equipment-p-2600.jpg 2600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a8d696a92c6259c97f2f216_Tungsten%20West%20Restart%20Equipment.jpg 3000w" class="image_cover"/></div><div class="content_carousel"><h3 class="heading-style-h6 heading-alternative text-color-white">A clear path to production </h3><div class="masked-content_carousel"><div class="inner_carousel-content"><p p-carousel-card="">A revised feasibility study, all permits in place, and construction underway. This is a project in motion, with nameplate production targeted for H2 2027.</p><div class="btn-wrap_card-carousel"><div class="btn-carousel_animation-wrapper"><a href="/project/hemerdon-mine" button="" data-wf--cta-primary--variant="primary" class="cta_primary w-inlin